# One false positive matched four times: trivy's node-pkg analyzer reads
# VS Code's bundled extension manifest
# usr/share/code/resources/app/extensions/npm/package.json (name "npm",
# version "1.0.1" — the extension's own) and takes it for the npm CLI at
# 1.0.1. No npm CLI is installed in this image. Re-test on a trivy bump.
CVE-2018-7408
CVE-2019-16775
CVE-2019-16776
CVE-2019-16777

